{
  "about": "Which of the web app's data-layer files the iPad's Swift core needs, for spike S1's 'measure the v1 logic subset' (R3). It is a judgement, made from docs/ipad-app-design.md's tracker; the Plan and status columns decide, not size. apps/ios/scripts/measure-logic-subset.mjs reads it, fails if a file in apps/web/src/lib/composition is missing from it, and prints the totals. Keys are paths relative to that folder; one ending in '/' covers a whole folder.",
  "categories": {
    "ported": "Built in Swift in S1 and checked against the desktop's code.",
    "v1": "Logic v1 needs that is not ported yet. The whole file counts.",
    "mixed": "Holds v1 logic among other things (orchestration, settings). Counted whole, so an upper bound for the v1 part.",
    "polish": "Tracker rows marked M3: release polish, the first to drop from v1.",
    "later": "The tracker says Later or Never, or has no row for it: not in v1.",
    "replaced": "Has a native replacement that is not a port (Meilisearch becomes FTS5, S2).",
    "plugin": "A plugin the design leaves out of v1 (C6): to-dos, RSS Reader, Reading List, AI helper.",
    "shell": "Transport, IPC, Next.js actions, desktop windows, updates, panels and type contracts: no logic to port."
  },
